# Brevity: this repository

Budgets (`scripts/check_brevity.py`): nested AGENTS.md ≤ 60 lines; docs page ≤ 1200 words; release-note bullet ≤ 60; issue note ≤ 350 (`Fixed issues` table ≤ 800); decision log ≤ 700 (≤ 120 per decision); architecture/handbook note ≤ 700.

Notebooks: markdown cell ≤ 150 words, code cell ≤ 40 lines, ≤ 900 markdown words per notebook; read a notebook with `jupyter nbconvert --to script --stdout`, never the raw file.
